{
  "name": "Morning Market",
  "category": "Pakistan business",
  "kind": "template",
  "summary": "A wholesale fruit and vegetable trader's desk in PKR: flip-board auction rates, growers, shops on credit",
  "about": "A nine-page desk for Haider & Sons Produce, a made-up trader at the Lahore wholesale market. A split-flap board flips the morning auction rates as bids land, and today's stock stands in the yard as stacks of little crates. Buying from growers, sales to shops on credit, truck arrivals, stock and wastage, a credit book, price charts and settings all work and keep their data in the browser.",
  "how": [
    "Open a page from the top bar: Today, Auction, Buying, Selling, Trucks, Stock, Credit book, Prices or Settings",
    "Watch the board on Today flip as bids land, switch it between five cities and tap a row for its price chart",
    "On Auction, pick a city, filter vegetables or fruit and record a lot you won; the crates join the stock",
    "Make a sale on credit, record a payment and send a reminder; credit limits and overdue days are checked",
    "Move trucks from the road to the gate and unload them, log wastage and set price alerts",
    "Press Ctrl+K to jump anywhere, close the day with a cash count and reset the demo data in Settings"
  ],
